# 🔐 Secure Encrypted Chat Application

A real-time secure chat web application built using Flask and SocketIO.

This project demonstrates secure messaging concepts including authentication, encrypted communication, and file sharing.

---

## 🚀 Features

- User Registration and Login
- Password Hashing for security
- Real-time chat using SocketIO
- Chat history stored in database
- File/Image upload
- Download chat history
- Animated login interface
- Clean chat UI

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- Flask-SocketIO
- SQLite
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

